cklist item that has been checked-off";s:42:"privacy:metadata:checklist_check:teacherid";s:62:"The ID of the teacher who last updated the status of this item";s:44:"privacy:metadata:checklist_check:teachermark";s:61:"The status allocated to this item, for the user, by a teacher";s:49:"privacy:metadata:checklist_check:teachertimestamp";s:62:"The time when the teacher last allocated a status to this item";s:39:"privacy:metadata:checklist_check:userid";s:109:"The ID of the user who has checked-off the item (or, if marked by a teacher, the user it was checked-off for)";s:46:"privacy:metadata:checklist_check:usertimestamp";s:87:"The time when the user last checked-off the item (0 if the item is currently unchecked)";s:34:"privacy:metadata:checklist_comment";s:106:"Information about comments that have been made by a teacher about the user's progress on a given checklist";s:44:"privacy:metadata:checklist_comment:commentby";s:51:"The ID of the user (teacher) that made this comment";s:41:"privacy:metadata:checklist_comment:itemid";s:56:"The ID of the checklist item that the comment relates to";s:39:"privacy:metadata:checklist_comment:text";s:23:"The text of the comment";s:41:"privacy:metadata:checklist_comment:userid";s:57:"The ID of the user (student) that this comment relates to";s:42:"privacy:metadata:checklist_comment_student";s:62:"Comments that have been made by a student on a given checklist";s:49:"privacy:metadata:checklist_comment_student:itemid";s:56:"The ID of the checklist item that the comment relates to";s:47:"privacy:metadata:checklist_comment_student:text";s:23:"The text of the comment";s:55:"privacy:metadata:checklist_comment_student:usermodified";s:51:"The ID of the user (student) that made this comment";s:44:"privacy:metadata:checklist_comp_notification";s:112:"Track which users have already completed all the items on their checklist, so that emails are not sent out again";s:56:"privacy:metadata:checklist_comp_notification:checklistid";s:23:"The ID of the 